# React Query

- All server state via TanStack Query hooks in `hooks/`
- Query keys: stable arrays, e.g. `["items"]`, `["items", id]`
- Mutations invalidate related query keys on success
- API functions live in `api/`; hooks call those functions
- Surface errors with toasts; don't swallow failures
- Don't duplicate server cache in Zustand
